  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/objects/Volume",
    "value": {
      "document": "沙箱存储卷。独立创建，或由 VolumeTemplate 按 ReuseKey 派生。",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>稳定 Volume ID，格式 vol-xxxxxxxx。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "VolumeId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "vol-a1b2c3d4",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>Volume 名称。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "VolumeName",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "agent-workspace",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>访问模式。</p><p>枚举值：</p><ul><li>ReadWriteOnce：单实例独占读写</li><li>ReadWriteMany：多实例共享读写</li><li>ReadOnlyMany：多实例共享只读</li></ul>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "AccessMode",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "ReadWriteMany",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>回收策略。</p><p>枚举值：</p><ul><li>Retain：派生出的 Volume 在沙箱删除后保留</li><li>Delete：派生出的 Volume 在沙箱删除后一并删除</li></ul>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "ReclaimPolicy",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "Retain",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>Volume 状态，例如 CREATING、ACTIVE。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "Status",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "ACTIVE",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>存储类型。Storage 中对应类型的字段必须与该值一致。</p><p>枚举值：</p><ul><li>Cos：使用 COS 作为存储后端</li><li>Cfs：使用 CFS 作为存储后端</li></ul>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "StorageType",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "Cos",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>真实存储信息；内部类型字段与 StorageType 一致。</p>",
          "member": "Storage",
          "name": "Storage",
          "required": false,
          "type": "object",
          "example": "无",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>派生该 Volume 的父模板 ID，格式 volt-xxxxxxxx。独立 Volume 为空。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "VolumeTemplateId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "volt-a1b2c3d4",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>模板派生复用键。独立 Volume 为空。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "ReuseKey",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "session-s001",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>标签。独立 Volume 为自有标签；派生 Volume 投影模板标签。</p>",
          "member": "Tag",
          "name": "Tags",
          "required": false,
          "type": "list",
          "example": "无",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>创建时间。</p>",
          "member": "datetime_iso",
          "name": "CreatedAt",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-07-21T08:00:00Z",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>更新时间。</p>",
          "member": "datetime_iso",
          "name": "UpdatedAt",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-07-21T08:00:00Z",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>访问底层存储使用的角色 ARN。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "StorageRoleArn",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "qcs::cam::uin/100000000001:roleName/AGSCOSRole",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>ReadWriteOnce Volume 当前被挂载的沙箱实例 ID。未挂载时为空。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "MountedInstanceId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "rd2xjhpjrs7qqdbg37dwxu7nfdqltvbo",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        }
      ],
      "type": "object",
      "usage": "output"
    }
  },
